\section{Related Work}
\label{sec:Related Work}
  For the extensive applications, surface reconstruction has been widely researched in the past decades. The vast majority of surface reconstruction methods based on implicit functions. According to the dependence on normal, we categorize these methods into two categories: oriented surface reconstruction and unoriented surface reconstruction.

