Similarly, Figure~\ref{fig11} presents the comparison between $\epsilon_{CT}$ and $\epsilon_{CL}$. For \textbf{Case~$\mathbf{1}$}, $\epsilon_{CT}$ outperforms $\epsilon_{CL}$ across all $m$, while in \textbf{Case~$\mathbf{2}$}, $\epsilon_{CL}$ consistently achieves lower error than $\epsilon_{CT}$.
