\subsubsection{Preparedness}

The results for participants' self-reported preparedness are presented in Table~\ref{tab:prepared}. Overall, less than 40\% ($n = 52$) of participants responded positively to being prepared for interviews, with the majority feeling uncertain about their preparedness. 

