However, the exact value of the $\Delta m_{np}^*$ depends on the number of the Taylor expansion of isospin asymmetry\cite{BALi2018PPNP,FYWang2023NST}, which means that the different truncations will lead to the different numerical errors.  
% \begin{equation}
