The projection of these zonotopes onto $\ZZ^2$ in the direction parallel to their last covered
segments is illustrated in Figure~\ref{fig:slrz_tight_last_covered_projections}.
The case $v=(1, 3, 4, 6)$ is notably distinct, as its last covered segment happens to be
parallel to one of its generators (the one associated with volume $3$).

